@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 12 to 15 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.5.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.5.0> ;
    owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.4.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1215corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.5.0 (2026-11-26): The Owner's ruling on the menu item is recorded and the mission widened (G216). Question put 2026-11-26 (answer options 1 to 3); answer 09:29 Istanbul: '1, yes. It should be a common rule for all chapters.' The ruling is a GovernanceRuling enforced by a shape in 03-materials/sen0414_page_shapes_v1_0_0.ttl (tested on the five newest page A-boxes of chapters 12 to 16: each fails as shipped and passes with the menu item planted; log 08-tooling/lineage12-opening/page_runorder_shape_test_v1_0_0.log). One objective is added for it, measured by that shape. The rule is common to all chapters; this lineage applies it to chapters 12 to 15 only, and the shape already shows chapter 16 without it, so the other chapters are named gaps for their own lineages (chapters 1 to 11 and 16 to 20 are excluded here by Excl12_OtherChapters)."""@en .

ex:Ruling12_RunInOrder a backlog:GovernanceRuling ;
    rdfs:label "Every chapter page has a top menu item that runs the slide examples in order"@en ;
    backlog:hasRulingIdentifier "SEN0414-PAGE-RUN-IN-ORDER" ;
    backlog:hasRulingStatement "Every chapter page of the course has a top menu item that runs the chapter's slide examples in order." ;
    backlog:enforcedByShape <http://example.org/sen0414/page-shapes#PageRunInOrderMenuShape> ;
    dcterms:source "Owner's ruling of 2026-11-24 for course materials, confirmed in his message of 2026-11-26 09:29 Istanbul: '1, yes. It should be a common rule for all chapters.' (the 2026-11-24 message itself was not re-read; the confirmation is verbatim)." .

ex:MissionAmendment12_1 a backlog:MissionAmendment ;
    rdfs:label "Mission 12 adds the menu item that runs the slide examples in order"@en ;
    backlog:amendsMission ex:Mission12 ; backlog:amendedBy backlog:Owner ;
    backlog:amendedMissionStatement "The chapter 12 (Command-Line Programs), chapter 13 (Web Scraping), chapter 14 (Excel Spreadsheets) and chapter 15 (Google Sheets) decks and interactive pages, already released, are corrected so that they meet the owner's rulings on decks and pages (one thing taught per slide, notes that carry the lecture and speak to the reader, a Slide code tab, plain code without prompts, only taught Python, no everyday analogies, checks and reviews recorded before release), with each chapter's approved content, stories and examples unchanged except where a ruling forces a change, reusing the conversion built for chapters 10, 11, 16 and 17. Every chapter page also carries a top menu item that runs the chapter's slide examples in order, a rule for every chapter of the course." ;
    backlog:amendmentReason "The mission of 1.0.0 did not name the menu item; the scope must not require what the mission does not say, so the mission is widened, never the scope stretched." ;
    backlog:amendmentRuling ex:Ruling12_RunInOrder .

ex:Del12_PageCode_12 backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "a top menu item that runs the chapter's slide examples in order" .
ex:Del12_PageCode_13 backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "a top menu item that runs the chapter's slide examples in order" .
ex:Del12_PageCode_14 backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "a top menu item that runs the chapter's slide examples in order" .
ex:Del12_PageCode_15 backlog:derivesFromMissionClause "a top menu item that runs the chapter's slide examples in order" .

ex:Scope12 backlog:hasAuditNote "The hold of 1.2.0 on the menu item is cleared (2026-11-26 09:29): the Owner confirmed the ruling for every chapter; it is recorded as a GovernanceRuling with its shape, and the mission is widened by amendment (1.5.0). The four PageCode deliverables and clause (e) of the scope text now stand." .

ex:Metric_Obj12_RunOrderMenu a backlog:Metric ; backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage12 ;
    backlog:metricBaseline "0"^^xsd:integer ; backlog:metricTarget "4"^^xsd:integer ; backlog:metricUnit "page" ;
    rdfs:label "Chapter pages of 12 to 15 whose main menu has the item that runs the slide examples in order: 0 -> 4"@en .
ex:CP12_RunOrderMenu a backlog:ObjectiveCheckpoint ; backlog:checkpointDate "2026-12-07T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:expectedValue "4"^^xsd:decimal .
ex:Obj12_RunOrderMenu a backlog:Objective ;
    rdfs:label "Chapter pages of 12 to 15 whose main menu has the item that runs the slide examples in order: 0 -> 4"@en ;
    backlog:belongsToLineage ex:Lineage12 ; backlog:objectiveForGoal ex:G12_PageRuns ; backlog:contributesToGoal ex:G12_PageRuns ;
    backlog:fillsScope ex:Scope12 ;
    backlog:hasMetric ex:Metric_Obj12_RunOrderMenu ; backlog:hasSuccessMetric ex:Metric_Obj12_RunOrderMenu ;
    backlog:hasMeasurementKind backlog:Meas_Counted ;
    backlog:hasMeasurementQuery "Count of chapters 12 to 15 whose newest page A-box conforms to shp:PageRunInOrderMenuShape (03-materials/sen0414_page_shapes_v1_0_0.ttl), run with pyshacl; today 0 of 4 (log 08-tooling/lineage12-opening/page_runorder_shape_test_v1_0_0.log)." ;
    backlog:hasBaselineValue "0"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasTargetValue "4"^^xsd:decimal ; backlog:hasTargetDirection backlog:Dir_Increase ;
    backlog:hasCheckpoint ex:CP12_RunOrderMenu ;
    backlog:hasForecastDate "2026-12-07"^^xsd:date ; backlog:hasForecastRationale "A forecast, not a deadline, on the same basis as the other objectives of this lineage (no observed velocity; Lineage10 pace; to be discussed with the Owner before it is final)." ;
    backlog:hasIntentOrigin backlog:IOrigin_SessionDrafted ; backlog:decidedBy backlog:Owner .
ex:Obs0_Obj12_RunOrderMenu a backlog:MetricObservation ; rdfs:label "Baseline of 2026-11-26: pages with the run-in-order menu item"@en ;
    backlog:observesMetric ex:Metric_Obj12_RunOrderMenu ; backlog:observationFor ex:Obj12_RunOrderMenu ; backlog:hasObservedValue "0"^^xsd:decimal ;
    backlog:observedAt "2026-11-26T06:30:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; backlog:observedDuringCeremony true ;
    backlog:hasObservationMethod "pyshacl of 03-materials/sen0414_page_shapes_v1_0_0.ttl on the newest page A-box of chapters 12 to 15: 0 of 4 conform." .
